@startuml 01-character-creation
!pragma layout smetana
title Creazione personaggi - Abstract Factory

left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
hide circle

class "characters.yaml\nenemies.yaml" as CharacterYaml <<asset>>
interface CharacterFactory <<Abstract Factory>>
class YamlCharacterFactory <<Concrete Factory>>
class AbilityRegistry <<Registry>>
abstract class Character
class Player
class Enemy <<Prototype>>

CharacterYaml --> YamlCharacterFactory
CharacterFactory <|.. YamlCharacterFactory
YamlCharacterFactory --> AbilityRegistry
YamlCharacterFactory --> Player : createPlayer
YamlCharacterFactory --> Enemy : createEnemy/copy
Character <|-- Player
Character <|-- Enemy

note bottom of CharacterFactory
Minimo: una factory crea Player ed Enemy nascondendo gli YAML.
end note
@enduml
